		{
			dependencies: ["7EFBAF3E281D2EBE"]
			description: ["The &bCapacity Card&f allows a bus upgraded with it to carry a larger filter. Import and Export buses upgraded with capacity cards can go from supporting only one filtered item each to their maximum nine-slot filter, while Storage buses will go from 18 slots to a maximum of 63."]
			id: "371A382CF1DDF2B2"
